## Quick Start

```bash
# Configure your API key
export {{ if eq (.vars.provider | default "anthropic") "anthropic" }}ANTHROPIC_API_KEY{{ else if eq .vars.provider "openai" }}OPENAI_API_KEY{{ else }}OLLAMA_HOST{{ end }}="your-key-here"

# Start the campaign
guild start
```

