## Configuration

Edit `.campaign/campaign.yaml` to:
- Add or modify guilds
- Configure providers
- Adjust daemon settings

## Usage

```bash
# Create a new commission (project spec)
guild commission create backend-api

# Start working on a commission
guild work backend-api

# Check status
guild status
```

